#: ../../../api/notes.md:1
msgid "Notes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/notes.md:1
msgid ""
"A collection of notes on one worksheet (`sheet.notes`) or across all "
"worksheets in a workbook (`book.notes`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/notes.md:3
msgid ""
"Iterate over `sheet.notes` to inspect one worksheet, or `book.notes` to "
"inspect every worksheet. If you already know the cell, access its note "
"directly with `sheet[\"A1\"].note`. Collections also support zero-based "
"indexing and lookup by cell address (`sheet.notes`) or a single-cell {class}"
"`Range <xlwings.Range>` (`book.notes`)."
msgstr ""

